@page
@model LarisVMS.Web.Pages.Setup.StorageModel
@{
    Layout = "_SetupLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Storage";
}
<h5 class="mb-3">3. Storage</h5>
<p class="text-muted small">
    Each recorder node writes to its own storage volume — you set that path when you install the node
    in the next step (<code>install-node.ps1 -StorageRoot &lt;path&gt;</code>), and you can change it
    or add an optional archive volume later on <strong>Admin &rarr; Nodes</strong>. There's nothing to
    configure here.
</p>
<form method="post">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Continue</button>
</form>
